Your contribution to something big: 
 As a Process & Industrialization Engineer , you will play a key role in driving continuous improvement, supporting production areas, and ensuring the effective industrialization of new products and technologies.
 Your contribution to something big: 
 Executing continuous improvement activities in production processes, focusing on quality, environment, safety, and efficiency, while preparing handbooks and performing process confirmation activities;
 Conducting cost‑benefit analyses, preparing technical specifications, and developing capacity studies to support investment approval;
 Providing technical support to production areas and creating documentation to sustain standardized production practices;
 Performing the technical approval of production equipment while ensuring corrective actions are implemented and validated;
 Developing studies for new products and assessing their impact on required investments;
 Collaborating in guideline workshops planning, including DFMA (Design for Manufacturing), to optimize product design for production efficiency;
 Contributing to D-FMEA (Failure Mode and Effects Analysis) by analyzing design risks and their effects on customer requirements;
 Performing P‑FMEA (Process Failure Mode and Effects Analysis) activities through process mapping, identifying failure modes and their effects on the product and customer;
 Supporting supplier selection by evaluating technical proposals according to project requirements (Lead Time, Quality, Investment, Risk);
 Coordinating equipment and investment setup within the factory, conducting final validation tests, and securing approvals from relevant departments to ensure compliance with Bosch norms and standards;
 Monitoring production performance after SOP (Start of Production) to ensure achievement of OEE (Overall Equipment Effectiveness) targets, identifying issues, analyzing root causes, and defining/implementing improvement measures;
 Identifying needs and implementing actions related to Industry 4.0, integrating digital solutions into production equipment and KPI monitoring systems.
