 Previous experience in industrialization, production engineering, or process optimization in an industrial environment;
 Solid knowledge of manufacturing processes, Lean Manufacturing, continuous improvement tools, FMEA, DFMA, and production planning;
 Experience with equipment specifications, industrial investments, and technical documentation;
 Familiarity with OEE and capacity studies.
 Languages 
 Good command of English and Portuguese (written and spoken).
 Working Style and Personality 
 Strong analytical and problem‑solving abilities;
 Proactive, autonomous and flexible mindset with a passion for technical excellence;
 Structured, results‑oriented, and able to manage multiple tasks concurrently;
 Comfortable working in cross‑functional teams with excellent communication and interpersonal skills.
